WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
See both cubes.

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.200
The cubes are covered.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.700
The covers swap positions.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.100
Remember where each cube is hidden.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:21.100
Uncover the blue cube.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:34.750
Uncover the red cube.
